msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:352
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "索引"

#: admin/config/index.php:356
msgid "Relative Ajax"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:358
msgid ""
"Try enabling this option if you are experiencing issues related to the "
"header field X-Requested-With not being allowed by Access-Control-Allow-"
"Headers in preflight response (or similar)."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:363
msgid "External pages"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:367
msgid "Allowed domains"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:369
msgid ""
"If you are getting an error saying that no 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin' "
"header is present on the requested resource, when using the external "
