"track, right before the closing BODY tag. Please make sure to change the "
"protocol of all the URLs to HTTPS, if your external site is using a secure "
"channel."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:387 admin/config/index.php:610
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "报告"

#: admin/config/index.php:391
msgid "Functionality"
msgstr "功能"

#: admin/config/index.php:395
msgid "Current month"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:397
msgid ""
"Determine what time window to use for the reports. Enable this option to "
"default to the current month, disable it to use the past X number of days "
"(see option below). Use the date and time filters for a more granular "
"analysis."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:400
msgid "Time range"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:402 admin/config/index.php:688
#: admin/view/wp-slimstat-db.php:134
msgid "days"
msgstr "天"

#: admin/config/index.php:403
msgid ""
"Default number of days in the time window used to generate all the reports. "
"We set it to 4 weeks so that the comparison charts will overlap nicely (i.e. "
"Monday over Monday) for a more meaningful analysis. This value is ignored if "
"the option above is turned on."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:406 admin/config/index.php:448
msgid "Rows to display"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:408 admin/config/index.php:451
#: admin/config/index.php:497
msgid "rows"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:409
msgid ""
"Define the number of rows to display in Top and Recent reports. You can "
"adjust this number to improve your server performance."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:412
msgid "IP geolocation"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:414
msgid ""
"Customize the URL of the geolocation service to be used in the Access Log. "
"Default value: <code>https://ip-api.com/#</code>"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:417
msgid "Comparison chart"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:419
msgid ""
"SlimStat displays two sets of charts, allowing you to compare the current "
"time window with the previous one. Disable this option if you find those "
"four charts confusing, and prefer seeing only the selected time range. "
"Please keep in mind that you can always temporarily hide one series by "
"clicking on the corresponding entry in the legend."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:422
msgid "Use display name"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:424
msgid ""
"By default, users are listed by their usernames. Enable this option to show "
"their display names instead."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:427
msgid "Display titles"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:429
msgid ""
"For improved legibility, most reports list post and page titles instead of "
"their permalinks. Use this option to change this behavior."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:432
msgid "Show hostnames"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:434
msgid ""
"Enable this option to display the hostname associated to each IP address. "
"Please note that this might affect performance, as SlimStat will need to "
"query your DNS server for each address."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:439
msgid "Access log and world map"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:443
msgid "Auto refresh"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:446
msgid ""
"When a value greater than zero is entered, the Access Log view will refresh "
"every X seconds. Enter <strong>0</strong> (the number zero) if you would "
"like to deactivate this feature."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:450
msgid "Define the number of rows to visualize in the Access Log."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:453
msgid "Map data points"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:455
msgid ""
"Customize the maximum number of data points displayed on the world map. "
"Please note that larger numbers might negatively affect rendering times."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:456
msgid "points"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:461
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "其他"

#: admin/config/index.php:465
msgid "Custom CSS"
msgstr "自定义CSS"

#: admin/config/index.php:469
msgid ""
"Enter your own stylesheet definitions to customize the way your reports "
"look. <a href='https://wp-slimstat.com/faq/how-can-i-change-the-colors-"
"associated-to-color-coded-pageviews-known-user-known-visitors-search-engines-"
"etc/' target='_blank'>Check our FAQs</a> for more information on how to use "
"this option."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:472
msgid "Chart colors"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:474
msgid ""
"Customize the look and feel of your charts by assigning your own colors to "
"each metric. List four hex colors, in the following order: metric 1 "
"previous, metric 2 previous, metric 1 current, metric 2 current. For "
"example: <code>#ccc, #999, #bbcc44, #21759b</code>."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:476
msgid "Mozscape access ID"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:478
msgid ""
"Get accurate rankings for your website through the <a href=\"https://moz.com/"
"community/join?redirect=/products/api/keys\" target=\"_blank\">Mozscape API</"
"a>. Sign up for a free community account to get started. Then enter your "
"personal identification code in this field."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:480
msgid "Mozscape secret key"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:482
msgid ""
"This key is needed to query the Mozscape API (see option above). Treat it "
"like a password and do not share it with anyone, or they will be able to "
"make API requests using your account."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:485
msgid "Show user agent"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:487
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want to see the full user agent string when "
"hovering over each browser icon in the Access Log and elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:490
msgid "Async mode"
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:492
msgid ""
"Activate this feature if your reports take a while to load. It breaks down "
"the load on your server into multiple smaller requests, thus avoiding memory "
"issues and performance problems."
msgstr ""

#: admin/config/index.php:495
msgid "SQL limit"
