msgid ""
"You can limit the number of records that each SQL query will take into "
"consideration when crunching aggregate values (maximum, average, etc). You "
"might need to adjust this value if you're getting an error saying that you "
"exceeded your PHP memory limit while accessing the slimstat."
msgstr ""

