#. translators: %s: a measured cost, e.g. "more than 8 minutes on a 440,000-row table (MySQL 8)".
#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddUserAgentDimension.php:108
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Groundwork for a future release: no report gets faster today. The slowest "
"step here: %s."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: a measured cost, e.g. "more than 8 minutes on a 440,000-row table (MySQL 8)".
#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddUserAgentDimension.php:117
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Optional. Adds a compact browser key to the analytics table and to the "
"archive table, and builds a lookup of browsers and platforms. It is "
"groundwork for a future release. It does not make any report faster today, "
"and it is by far the slowest step here: %s. That run was stopped before it "
"finished, so it is a minimum and not an estimate. On a larger table you may "
"not be able to complete it from this screen at all. Your existing data is "
"not modified, and reports keep working while it runs. Tracking normally "
"keeps working too, but a server that cannot rebuild the table online will "
"pause tracking writes for the whole rebuild, so on a large site prefer a "
"quiet period."
msgstr ""

#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddVisitIdentity.php:71
msgid "Add the anonymous visitor identity column"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: a measured cost, e.g. "about 8 seconds on a 440,000-row table (MySQL 8)".
#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddVisitIdentity.php:78
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Groups visitors tracked without cookies into visits. Each table takes %s."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: a measured cost, e.g. "about 8 seconds on a 440,000-row table (MySQL 8)".
#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddVisitIdentity.php:87
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Adds a private, full-width identity column for visitors tracked without "
"cookies. Until it runs, anonymous pageviews are still recorded but cost "
"extra database work on every hit and cannot be grouped into visits reliably. "
"The analytics table and its archive are each rebuilt in place: %s, so "
"roughly double that if you also have archived data, and longer on bigger "
"tables. Tracking and reports normally keep working while it runs, but a "
"server that cannot rebuild online will pause tracking writes until it "
"finishes. No existing data is changed or removed."
msgstr ""

